# GNOME settings, one per line: schema key value. bin/gnome applies them
# with gsettings, task status shows which differ. Values are GVariant text,
# as gsettings prints them.

# Space is a plain space at every modifier level. The Norwegian layout puts
# a no-break space on AltGr+Space, which is invisible and breaks commands
# and code, and every other nbsp variant puts another invisible character
# there instead.
org.gnome.desktop.input-sources xkb-options ['nbsp:none']
